{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A horror game about a blogger who uncovers the truth behind urban legends.</strong> <br>The first story takes place in an eerie shopping mall, where the protagonist takes a job as a night security guard to investigate a chilling rumor: every year, on this very night, guards mysteriously vanish without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/0021cca3c7950ce062c90b275d6fc792.poster.avif?t=1771576957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/0021cca3c7950ce062c90b275d6fc792.webm?t=1771576957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the past is never truly buried\u2026 Long ago, a circus stood here. It burned down in a terrible fire, claiming many lives. Now, the shadows of that tragedy seem to linger within the mall\u2019s walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/0d76ba6d919d828f1f1793fbdec45ae6.poster.avif?t=1771576957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/0d76ba6d919d828f1f1793fbdec45ae6.webm?t=1771576957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to gather clues, uncover the story of the fire, and discover <strong>why the circus became a cursed place\u2014and who really perished that night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/70d5e6318fcdeb2b4aae97a86610101d.poster.avif?t=1771576957\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/70d5e6318fcdeb2b4aae97a86610101d.webm?t=1771576957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/extras/70d5e6318fcdeb2b4aae97a86610101d.mp4?t=1771576957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050230?t=1771576957","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050230?t=1771576957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/31a2b4ad63433b3bdf4a37e75da1d12894ba7226/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771576957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050230/31a2b4ad63433b3bdf4a37e75da1d12894ba7226/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771576957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"As you delve into the world of our game, you will encounter a grim and brutal reality. You can expect bloody battles, murder scenes, and an atmosphere of constant tension. This project is designed for those who appreciate horror and are not afraid of explicit scenes of violence.\r\n\r\nIt is important to note that the plot and gameplay do not touch on topics of sexual violence, racism, or contain nudity or drug promotion."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A horror game about a blogger who uncovers the truth behind urban legends.</strong> <br>The first story takes place in an eerie shopping mall, where the protagonist takes a job as a night security guard to investigate a chilling rumor: every year, on this very night, guards mysteriously vanish without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas